      "value": "We are translating at DeepL.\nThank you for contacting us.\nI have tried the places you mentioned.\nUnfortunately, I could not upload an avatar.\nWe tried two different methods.\n(1) Detach the ID of VRC Avatar Desciptor -> Upload as a new avatar\n(2) Detach the ID of VRC Avatar Desciptor → Copy the ID of my previously uploaded avatar → Upload as an update of the existing avatar\nI get a message about the image I sent you no matter which way I do it.\nAlso, each time I upload an avatar, the link to my SDK account is broken.",
